  "renames_note": "Class A keys retired from the 0.30.x set. osm-context and osm-maintain-context were renamed to osm-data-context and osm-manage-data-context. osm-check, osm-update and osm-select-model were folded into references under osm; the mapped key is where the method now lives. content and diffusion-studio left the package and have no destination key; their history is the v0.30.1 tag and docs/content-drafts. Informational only: it changes no writer, row or public page. OSM 0.33.0 replaces osm-orchestrate-workers with osm-council. OSM 0.34.0 has seven discoverable SKILL.md entries. The osm, osm-data-context, osm-manage-data-context and osm-manage-skills folders now supply reference resources only; historical renames into them remain in v0.33.0 history, not current released-skill rows.",
